sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant AuthController
    participant AuthService
    participant PasswordEncoder
    participant UserRepository
    participant VerificationTokenRepository
    participant Database

    Client->>AuthController: POST /api/v1/auth/register<br/>{email, password, displayName, role}
    AuthController->>AuthService: register(RegisterRequest)

    alt Role is not BUYER or SELLER
        AuthService-->>AuthController: throw BusinessException("Invalid role")
        AuthController-->>Client: 400 Bad Request
    end

    AuthService->>UserRepository: existsByEmail(email)
    UserRepository->>Database: SELECT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM users WHERE email = ?)
    Database-->>UserRepository: boolean
    UserRepository-->>AuthService: true/false

    alt Email already registered
        AuthService-->>AuthController: throw BusinessException("Email already registered")
        AuthController-->>Client: 400 Bad Request
    end

    Note right of AuthService: Create User entity<br/>verified=false<br/>authenticationType=LOCAL

    AuthService->>PasswordEncoder: encode(password)
    PasswordEncoder-->>AuthService: BCrypt hash
    AuthService->>UserRepository: save(User)
    UserRepository->>Database: INSERT INTO users (email, password_hash, display_name, role, verified, authentication_type) VALUES (?, ?, ?, ?, false, 'LOCAL')
    Database-->>UserRepository: User (with generated UUID)
    UserRepository-->>AuthService: saved User

    Note right of AuthService: Generate verification token<br/>UUID, expires in 24h

    AuthService->>VerificationTokenRepository: save(VerificationToken)
    VerificationTokenRepository->>Database: INSERT INTO verification_tokens (user_id, token, expires_at) VALUES (?, ?, ?)
    Database-->>VerificationTokenRepository: VerificationToken
    VerificationTokenRepository-->>AuthService: saved VerificationToken

    Note right of AuthService: Log token (email service not implemented)

    AuthService-->>AuthController: UserResponse
    AuthController-->>Client: 201 Created<br/>{message: "Registration successful", data: UserResponse}
